integration_seam {"location":"Future reviewed runner admission/dispatch wrapper after existing manifest and explicit paired plan creation, before the first provider request; delivery retention before any legacy parsing; policy audit alongside unchanged record/envelope/grouping validation before comparison reporting.","inputs":"Immutable manifest/plan/settings and external prospective freeze receipt with full order, identity mapping, budgets and trusted preflight evidence.","outputs":"Append-only dispatch/stop/reservation/delivery/rejection ledgers referencing full existing identities and byte evidence; unchanged valid legacy records or null, unchanged synthetic envelope records where representable, separate policy audit and complete/missing/unstarted inventories.","duplicate_boundary":"Same-attempt redelivery is recognized at ingestion only with complete identity/byte and no-second-execution proof; preserve every delivery externally and supply one unique attempt row. If duplicate rows are passed to the old checker, it continues to reject them. This proposal does not modify it.","implementation_status":"No such wrapper, ledger implementation, validator adapter or real envelope admission path is added or authorized here. Separately scoped integration preparation and review are required."}
freeze_contract {"identity_encoding":"Manifest and plan hashes use exact original bytes. Canonical settings use UTF-8 JSON, keys sorted, separators comma/colon, ensure_ascii false, as in the pinned 0138 synthetic setting identity; future typed real settings require reviewed serialization and binding.","acyclic_sequence":["Independently review/freeze the policy document bytes and record policy hash externally; it does not contain a hash of itself.","After required reviewed development pilots and owner records, fill a new manifest instance using existing fields; stopping_rule references this policy_id and hash, sampling_order references the finite proposed order, precision_cost_plan_revision pins precision evidence and revision. Leave the template and its null reasons unchanged.","Materialize explicit plan slots/comparisons from that manifest, with immutable manifest hash; derive the finite order using R04 and freeze a separate receipt binding policy hash, manifest hash, plan hash, canonical settings hash and full dispatch order. Existing plan slot inventory order is not an executed order claim.","Independently verify receipt identities/authority and budget reservations before any request. Refuse missing/null/mismatched values. Recheck gates per slot; no post-failure continuation or evaluation-driven change under the same freeze."],"current_receipt":null}
preflight {"all_applicable_manifest_fields_required":{"provider_and_settings":["provider","exact_model_snapshot","snapshot_pinning_limitations_and_run_window","model_image_capabilities","generation_settings","generation_seeds_and_support"],"matched_inputs_and_reader":["common_prompt_and_hash","question_input_hashes","original_artifact_set_and_hashes","permitted_documentation_and_hashes","native_images_and_unavailable_modalities","arm_specific_tool_instructions","reader_commit","reader_configuration","tool_schema"],"method_revisions":["runner_version","scorer_version","split_revision","case_key_revision","native_evidence_versions"],"resources":["matched_total_token_budget","matched_context_budget","matched_output_budget","matched_wall_time_budget","tool_call_limits_and_accounting","truncation_and_exhaustion_recording"],"finite_scheduling":["independent_repetitions_per_case_arm","sampling_order","paired_arm_randomization","stopping_rule","affordable_run_ceiling","precision_cost_plan_revision"],"trusted_boundary":["fresh_session_and_memory_isolation","restricted_access_evidence","data_recipients_retention_and_grant","raw_run_record_schema_and_storage"],"scoring":["task_reference_inventory_revision","claim_mapping_and_adjudication_revision","dimension_outcome_rules_revision","fixed_denominators"],"separate_probes":["probe_suite_revision","probe_native_reference_revision","separate_probe_session_limits","probe_raw_alignment_and_outcome_records","no_reader_fidelity_not_applicable_record"],"coverage_and_accounting":["coverage_strata_and_pair_accounting","required_item_and_extra_claim_reporting","elapsed_and_tool_time_accounting","input_output_token_accounting","provider_cost_basis","infrastructure_cost_basis","cache_retry_queue_and_unpriced_accounting","separate_probe_time_and_cost_accounting"],"precision_and_freeze":["per_case_tolerances_and_nondeterminism","uncertainty_procedure","confidence_level","resampling_seed_and_count","independent_lineage_units_and_repeat_preservation","missing_pair_treatment","exclusions_and_aggregation_weights","small_sample_and_unavailable_scope_reporting","owner_precision_target_and_acceptance_record"]},"validation":"Presence alone is insufficient: independently checked byte identities, permitted routing, trusted storage/usage/model/isolation receipts, accepted method revisions, parity, supported modalities, case inventories and finite affordable order must all agree. A field with a genuine not-applicable case needs a predeclared reviewed justification, not a silently cleared null. Any unmet applicable requirement blocks scheduling.","prospective_freeze_receipt_fields":["policy_id and policy document SHA256","manifest exact-byte SHA256","plan exact-byte SHA256 and finite slot/comparison inventories","canonical settings SHA256","full ordered slot tuples and per-arm repetition maps","preflight evidence inventories with hashes/locations/authority","reviewer identity, scope, UTC, method and immutable receipt","owner acceptance/precision/quota records where required","hard per-request and total ceilings, reservation/usage mapping and run window","freeze UTC preceding every request; independent verification receipt"],"availability":"These substantive real receipts and a real filled configuration are unavailable. No real freeze or schedule exists."}
state_model {"plan_nonterminal":["ready","running"],"plan_terminal":["blocked_preflight","finished_complete","finished_incomplete","stopped_hard_failure","stopped_settings_drift","stopped_budget"],"slot_terminal_classification":["unstarted_with_cause","attempted_eligible","attempted_ineligible","unresolved"],"slot_notes":"Unresolved is always ineligible for completion. Missing/unstarted are separate inventory flags; a retained unsolicited attempt can make an unstarted slot present. In-flight is temporary; stop preserves its evidence and classification gaps explicitly, without inventing an attempt_event.","late_evidence":"Operational terminal state/history is immutable; final audit and structural-completion inventory may worsen as late evidence arrives. Never reopen dispatch or select a replacement. Historical complete counts remain versioned, not erased.","stop_priority":["hard_evidence_failure","settings_drift","budget"],"stop_log":"Earliest detected stop prevents all further dispatch. Retain all same-gate causes, using priority only to select the primary state; no success-based override."}
